                <pb facs="0240" n="234" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg234"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Seat to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bluefields, Nicaragua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Honduras invading at Gape Gracias. Lives and millions property American citizens
                    unprotected. Appeal for man-of-war to Bluefields Mosquito Reservation, at
                    once.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Seat</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consular Agent</hi></signed>,<lb/>(and fifty citizens of the United
                    States).</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
